      "job": {
        "title": "Full Stack Developer (MERN + AI Integration)",
        "company": "Sidat",
        "location": "Karachi, PSD, PK",
        "url": "https://pk.indeed.com/viewjob?jk=18e31c2fb7d8c1b3",
        "platform": "Indeed",
        "date_posted": "2026-09-08T00:00:00+00:00",
        "is_remote": false,
        "description": "**About the Role**\n\nWe're looking for a Full Stack Developer with a strong front\\-end foundation who's also comfortable working across the backend and, increasingly, with AI\\-powered features. While the core focus is building responsive, high\\-quality user interfaces on the MERN stack, we want someone who can integrate APIs, work with backend services, and pick up basic LLM/GenAI integration (chatbots, AI\\-assisted features, API\\-based AI tools) as our products evolve. We're looking for 1\\+ year of hands\\-on experience, strong problem\\-solving instincts, and a track record of shipping independent projects.\n\n**Key Responsibilities**\n\n* Develop responsive, interactive web applications with a primary focus on front\\-end development\n* Build reusable UI components using Next.js, React.js, HTML, CSS, Tailwind, and JavaScript\n* Integrate APIs and work with Node.js, Fastify, Express.js, and MongoDB (or equivalent: FastAPI, PostgreSQL)\n* Translate UI/UX designs into functional, responsive interfaces\n* Assist in integrating AI/LLM\\-powered features into applications (e.g. chatbots, AI\\-assisted workflows) using tools like the OpenAI API or LangChain, under guidance\n* Containerize and help deploy applications using Docker; basic exposure to CI/CD pipelines is a plus\n* Debug, optimize, and maintain clean, scalable code\n* Collaborate with designers, backend developers, and the wider team on shared projects\n\n**Requirements**\n\n* 1\\+ year of relevant experience in MERN Stack development\n* Strong proficiency in Next.js, React.js, JavaScript, HTML5, and CSS3\n* Working knowledge of Node.js, Express.js, PostgreSQL and MongoDB\n* Experience with API integration and Git\\-based workflows\n* Exposure to or interest in AI/LLM tooling (OpenAI API, LangChain, prompt engineering) is a strong plus, not mandatory\n* Basic familiarity with Docker/cloud deployment (AWS or similar) is a plus\n* At least 2–3 independent or portfolio projects you can speak to in detail — your role, decisions, and trade\\-offs\n* Strong debugging and problem\\-solving skills\n* Comfortable writing and reasoning about your own code independently — AI coding tools are welcome as an aid, not a substitute for understanding your code\n* Curiosity and willingness to pick up new tools, frameworks, or practices as projects demand\n\n**What We Offer**\n\n* Hands\\-on work on real\\-world, production web applications with growing AI integration\n* Exposure to modern front\\-end, full\\-stack, and applied AI development practices\n* Room to grow from Front\\-End into broader Full\\-Stack and AI\\-integrated engineering roles\n\n**Office Location:** Shahrah\\-e\\-Faisal, Karachi  \n**Timings:** 10:00 AM – 7:00 PM  \n**Work Location:** In\\-person\n\nInterested candidates can send their CV along with GitHub, portfolio, or project links to **apply4dev@sidat.net** with the subject line: **\"Application – Full Stack Developer (MERN \\+ AI Integration)\"**\n\nWork Location: In person",
